  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    non_empty = []\n    start_idx = -1\n    for i, row in enumerate(grid):\n        if any(x != 0 for x in row):\n            if start_idx == -1:\n                start_idx = i\n            non_empty.append(row)\n            \n    if not non_empty:\n        return grid\n        \n    L = len(non_empty)\n    out = []\n    for i in range(len(grid)):\n        out.append(list(non_empty[(i - start_idx) % L]))\n        \n    return out\n```",
